Comment: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:30.25,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,JP-定位点 name
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:36.72,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}看吧 这一切都如初
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:44.18,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}一如平常 你的描摹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:48.10,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}玻璃般的线条略过
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:53.78,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}看吧 这些恢复如初
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:59.86,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}细碎但总能有一日
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:07.96,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}我也不明 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.96,0:21:15.55,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}魔法现在 藏哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.55,0:21:23.68,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,240)}捉迷藏 继续看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:30.69,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\fad(240,0)}祈愿 留到明天吧
Comment: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,CN,,0,0,0,,OP前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,下一题 久世
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.35,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,啊 好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.95,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,答案是六点六噼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:15.28,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,答案是 六点六
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.58,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,正确
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:22.91,CN,Girl N,0,0,0,,声音好小 根本听不见说的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:30.02,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈什么都没有做呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.59,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:36.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,也许 这说不定是和好的第一步噼
Comment: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:52.58,CN - down,,0,0,0,,正文
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.58,0:01:56.99,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}感觉 我好久没有和别人一起散步了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:58.47,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,是吗噼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:06.05,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,以前 我还经常和父亲一起出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:07.52,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,原来你有爸爸啊噼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:12.43,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,有的 不过他在我小时候就出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:15.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,原来也有这种情况啊 人类
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:23.73,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那天父亲离开的夜晚 也像现在一样星星满天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:28.27,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,我拼命地向星星大人祈愿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:34.12,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,「希望爸爸妈妈不要离婚」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:37.93,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但 根本没有实现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:47.37,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那时候我就想 魔法并没有 神明也不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:54.22,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,听到静香说这些话 我还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:59.19,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,总感觉我们的关系变得更好了 好开心噼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:04.33,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,「上次」像这样抬头仰望繁星之时 要更加
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.15,0:03:07.08,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:12.47,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,那个时候记得是和静香相遇的第六天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:14.43,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,正好就是今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.43,0:03:18.32,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,然后 静香自杀的日子 就是那一天之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.88,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,也就是 明天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:24.50,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香拿着恰噼的项圈来到公园里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:27.99,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:32.15,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,为什么那个时候 恰噼它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:36.08,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不在呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:41.77,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,在这个时间出来 真够下贱的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:45.28,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,果然 卖屁股也是会遗传的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:47.16,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,麻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.42,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:52.53,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊 是污秽的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:54.70,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:55.14,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,之前我就在想了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:59.84,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,寄生虫和淫妇还有资格养狗吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.54,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰噼快回来 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:04.18,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,我再问你话 快回答我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:07.27,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,一个人无法生活的寄生虫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:10.15,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,连狗屎都没资格购买的贱货 我在问你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.53,0:04:11.19,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}麻 麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:13.53,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}她不是变得温柔了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.03,0:04:17.13,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我好害怕动不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.03,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.14,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.09,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,好痛 有谁能救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.95,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,狗 恐怖的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:36.33,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,袭击了我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:37.58,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,快报警还有联系医院
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:39.34,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,快点把它给抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.32,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这是发生了啥噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.43,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.46,0:04:50.89,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,等会 恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.28,0:04:54.63,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,哭了 静香她竟然哭了噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:57.91,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这样子绝对不行的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.32,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:04.05,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我会想办法解决噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.72,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章鱼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.27,0:05:12.70,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,改变下散步的路线吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.18,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.23,0:05:17.69,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,这条路上 有什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:18.94,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:19.84,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,今天 只要不经过公园
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:22.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不碰见麻里奈的话就没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:24.55,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊 在这在这
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:24.14,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:28.27,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这个趋势不对劲噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:30.72,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,换成早上散步怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:35.15,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,散步明天再去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.38,0:05:40.44,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞 好奇怪噼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:44.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不管在哪里 无论多少次恰噼它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:48.54,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,好 进展顺利 没关系的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:51.50,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,不枉我好找了一番啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:53.12,CN,Teacher B,0,0,0,,小姑娘 你没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:53.87,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:57.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,原来是麻里奈主动找的她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:56.43,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}我什么都没做它就突然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.12,CN,Teacher B,0,0,0,,已经可以放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.47,0:06:01.38,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,诶 但是这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:04.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,想要避开她就会变得很困难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:08.95,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,而且麻里奈为什么要来故意被狗咬呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:12.15,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,明明很痛的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:18.19,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,对啦 去问问同样是人类的静香吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:21.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,说不定就能知道麻里奈的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:24.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:26.90,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,有个问题想要问问你噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.33,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:33.59,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,等我 别丢下我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:39.45,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:43.97,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这样子的话 静香她会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.49,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:54.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我绝对会 帮助你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:04.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,为了让你一直 能和恰噼欢声笑语每一日
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:07.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,就算这次不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:11.12,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,只要能无数次重来 肯定能找到解决的办法噼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.02,0:07:15.91,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,为了让你 不再做悲伤的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:20.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,所以请你 相信我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.93,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章鱼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:28.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这次的我一定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.87,0:07:36.65,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,会让你 绽放最美好的微笑噼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.51,0:07:45.03,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,所以 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.49,0:07:49.29,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,恰噼的话 就送去你爸那了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:53.64,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,咬了人的狗不能在这镇上住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.18,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,所以总有一天你能去找它的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.93,0:08:07.03,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:14.69,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,归根结底 明明是那家伙擅自留下来的狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.56,0:08:16.69,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,啊 还有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:21.63,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,麻里奈是吧 她的伤也不算太严重
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:24.70,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,但她母亲云母坂女士好像挺生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.35,0:08:27.33,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,真的 麻烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:31.44,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,碍于那个人的面子 我还得去道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:36.45,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,真的 你别再给我惹麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:41.54,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,那就这 我先去工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:45.63,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,晚饭你随便吃点吧 早上我就会回去的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.25,0:08:48.88,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,说起来 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:52.58,CN,Shizuka's mom,0,0,0,,你头上带着折耳根花做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:56.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,那之后我无论尝试多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.03,0:09:01.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,无论如何恰噼都会被带走噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:05.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,但是 我绝对不会放弃噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.09,0:09:10.38,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,毕竟 静香现在还好好地活着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:13.12,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,所以我会努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:16.48,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,把恰噼从她爸爸那边给带回来的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.51,0:09:19.68,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.96,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我一定会把恰噼给带回来的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:25.84,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,所以 我希望你能打起精神噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:31.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,「爸爸的那边」是在哪里呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:34.56,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我现在就去看看噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:40.36,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香 你肚子饿不饿噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:44.67,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,来吧 这是午餐的面包 来吃吧噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:55.68,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要怎么样做 你才能绽放笑容呢噼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:00.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,对啦噼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:03.07,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,去学校和大家见面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:07.08,CN,Boy I,0,0,0,,哇 果然她真的来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.02,CN,Marina's friend A,0,0,0,,听说了吗 麻里奈她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:11.39,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,听说了 听说了 受了好严重的伤呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:12.04,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,{\an8}肯定是这个人叫狗咬她的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.08,CN,Boy I,0,0,0,,{\an8}居然还 有脸回学校
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:28.24,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊哈 这不是那个管理不好臭狗的害人女嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:29.90,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,早上好呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.80,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你还真敢来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.82,0:10:35.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:38.55,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,那么 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:41.39,CN,Teacher,0,0,0,,下节课要走班 不要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:45.39,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,麻里奈我啊 手可是血流成河啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:46.71,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,好过分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:47.95,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,要赔偿医药费呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:51.92,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,说不定还会得狂犬病呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:53.81,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.17,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,道歉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.76,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,呐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.74,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,云 云母坂同学
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:05.57,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,下节课要去音乐室 赶紧过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:09.44,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,啊 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.79,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,音乐课要带什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:13.37,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,竖笛和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.37,0:11:16.42,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,久 久世同学 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:19.44,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,身体不舒服的话可以去医务室
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:23.29,CN,Azuma,0,0,0,,如果有我能帮上忙的 尽管
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.35,0:11:34.81,CN,Marina's friend C,0,0,0,,呐 那家伙不管什么都没反应真的太恶心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:36.83,CN,Marina's friend A,0,0,0,,好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.83,0:11:38.48,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,明天 怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:40.19,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:46.11,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,大家抱歉 今天各位先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:47.86,CN,Marina's friend B,0,0,0,,诶 是有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.01,CN,Marina's friend A,0,0,0,,这样啊 明天再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:07.22,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:19.38,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香 完全没有精神噼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.39,0:12:23.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊 难不成
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:27.51,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,你是不是肚子饿了 午餐你都没怎么吃噼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:29.11,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,寄生虫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:31.24,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻 麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:35.09,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,有事和你说 借一步说话呗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:43.45,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,别无视我 臭女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:53.24,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,来聊聊 静香你最喜欢的「可爱恰噼」吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:56.10,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.99,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香她说话了噼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:58.98,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}那么 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:02.07,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这样就能精神地和麻里奈沟通
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:06.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不 这不对噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:09.44,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这说不定是个好机会噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:12.69,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这次两人说不定会和好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:16.60,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,既然如此 我也不能再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:19.49,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,虽然恐惧 但也要勇敢面对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:24.93,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我要帮助两人和好如初噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.27,0:13:27.79,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,等等我噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:33.80,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:42.15,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,你就不能回来早一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.90,CN,Marina's dad,0,0,0,,又是这句话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.90,0:13:46.32,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,麻里她也是很寂寞的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:46.77,CN,Marina's dad,0,0,0,,{\an8}我可是在外面辛勤工作但是你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.71,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,麻里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:54.27,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,麻里 你能明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.16,0:13:57.86,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,只有你永远
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.30,0:14:02.16,CN,Marina's mom,0,0,0,,站在妈妈这边吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰 恰噼的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:23.79,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,那狗 早死了 怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.58,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,它没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.58,0:14:28.57,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.15,0:14:32.55,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,没有死的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.00,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}早死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.00,0:14:34.66,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,死了 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,它去了爸爸在的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:38.54,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}早就死了 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:41.40,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,随时回来都可以的 看这是它的项圈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:46.49,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,咬了孩子的手 送到动物收治所
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.87,0:14:50.08,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,它必然会死的 傻逼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:54.50,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你个杂草爸爸都没 温柔的妈妈也不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:58.13,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,没有朋友 谁也不会关心你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:15:01.04,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,唯一一个和你下贱的狗也死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:05.18,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,呐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:08.21,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你也死了算
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:11.81,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,恐怖噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:13.82,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,恐恐恐恐 恐怖噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:18.21,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}活着净是给人添麻烦的寄生虫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:18.09,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,非常恐怖噼 恐怖到一步都走不动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.31,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.12,0:15:23.50,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你觉得你的生活费是从哪里来的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:26.70,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,是从我爸爸的钱包里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:29.87,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,你穿的衣服 吃的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:34.32,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,全部都是你他妈 从男人身下吸上来的钱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:34.78,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰 噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:38.68,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,明明是我的爸爸每天努力干活挣钱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.74,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:41.54,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,「要是你不在的话」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:53.80,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,爸爸就会给妈妈 买新的戒指并送给她
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:16:00.62,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,不是那种素未谋面的妓女 而是更关心麻里奈的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:07.98,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,不 不不不不 不好啦噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.44,0:16:11.77,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香她 肯定非常痛的噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.77,0:16:13.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要马上去帮助她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:15.17,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,对啦噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.17,0:16:18.45,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我要用快乐相机 再次重新来过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:19.04,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,{\an8}烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.04,0:16:23.09,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,要是你不生在世上 妈妈她就会和以前一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.18,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,恰噼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:29.14,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,只要有恰噼在 我就没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:32.23,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,其它一切无所谓的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:35.18,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,就算发生什么也都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.87,0:16:40.10,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,无论多么痛苦 多么难受
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:42.69,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:45.08,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这样子的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:50.26,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,若只是旁观 肯定会重蹈覆辙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:52.77,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:55.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:57.80,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.61,0:17:00.75,CN,Marina,0,0,0,,把我爸爸还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:02.48,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要拿出勇气出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.00,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:11.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这次的我 绝对要「拯救」你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:38.14,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:43.49,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈 她一动也不动了噼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.89,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,难道是太痛了吗噼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:48.67,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:50.92,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,麻里奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:54.83,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,感觉好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:56.95,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,虽然痛痛 不是什么好事情噼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:18:00.44,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,要赶快用快乐相机重新来过 好好沟通一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.65,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,啊嘞噼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:13.63,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,她死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:16.06,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:20.42,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,她绝对 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:24.80,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,死 欸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.58,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,是我的错吧 什么东西红红的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.73,0:18:28.59,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,{\an8}麻里奈死了 快乐相机无法运作
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:29.97,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,怎么办 故障了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.75,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章鱼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:39.30,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章鱼噼 你好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.48,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,欸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:45.39,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,好厉害好厉害好厉害 真的好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:48.92,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,我啊 虽然一直都不相信魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:51.86,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但实际上 我一直都在想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:55.37,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,麻里奈要是不在的话就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.37,0:18:57.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,这样 我就不会讨厌学校了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.95,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但是 我什么都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.21,0:19:04.78,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,反正这个愿望也不会被实现
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:07.72,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,但是 真的成真了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.64,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,真的实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.12,0:19:12.57,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:15.50,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,就像是魔法一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:19.97,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,是 是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:21.23,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:23.64,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,魔法真的存在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:26.34,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那肯定恰噼也还活着的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:30.48,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,只要去爸爸在的地方 肯定能再见的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:36.23,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,这 真的可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.23,0:19:37.50,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,章鱼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:42.65,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,谢谢你 章鱼噼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:45.43,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,谢谢你「杀了」她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:49.00,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,在你们人类的语言里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:53.59,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,剥夺他人生命被称为「杀人」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.34,0:19:58.87,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,静香她 终于对我笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:02.91,CN,Shizuka,0,0,0,,那么 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:08.61,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,太阳系第三行星地球
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.21,0:20:12.16,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,从快乐星球到达这里的第七天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:22.66,CN,Takopi,0,0,0,,我的真正「故事」从此刻「无法重新来过 」开始
